    <briefdescription>
<para>Secure Transport Client. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Shared transport abstraction for secure data transfer between shards. Reuses WAL shipper transport capabilities:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>mTLS for secure communication</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Compression (Zstd/LZ4) for efficient transfer</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Retry logic with exponential backoff</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Integrity checks (checksums/signatures)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Used by both <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_w_a_l_shipper" kindref="compound">WALShipper</ref> and AdapterSyncManager to avoid code duplication. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
